<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: qubit decryption -->
  <DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.label>
  <!-- EN: A decoding technique that bypasses a stele&apos;s own verification layer and reads its data by directly measuring the quantum state held at each lattice site of its holographic storage plates. The stele&apos;s encryption rests on the assumption that no one outside the fleets can observe those quantum states without collapsing them; this technique simply chooses to accept the collapse. Every reading permanently destroys the region it reads. What is recovered can be archived for research, and what is lost can never be restored.\nThe technique was leaked by fleet deviants. Steles are the backup memory of every colonial world, and every stele scanned this way is a record that no one will ever be able to read again.\n\nApproved by ████ and ███, qubit decryption and its related technologies are designated class II sealed technology. Disclosure of such technology is prohibited, and any decoding equipment discovered is to be destroyed on site. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file II: qubit decryption -->
  <DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology. It contains a stele decryption technique leaked by fleet deviants.\n\nThe decoder can now be built. Set flush against a stele and supplied with power, it can extract the occultech knowledge stored in the stele.\n\nWith this method in hand, the colony can also trace the occultech glyphs scattered across this world. Recovering the glyphs will lead to a stele.\n\nThe fleets sealed this file to keep the data in the steles out of anyone else&apos;s hands. Every stele read this way is a permanent loss to the fleets. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_QubitDecryption.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: enclosed assault frame -->
  <DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.label>
  <!-- EN: A load-bearing frame anchored directly into the pilot&apos;s skeleton, driven by artificial muscle bundles that only draw at full closure. It allows a single soldier to carry and operate armament far beyond their own muscular limit. Because closure is a precondition of output, the device cannot be released by any conventional means once sealed, and separation of the pilot must be performed surgically.\nThis inability to self-release classifies the device, under the laws of war, as restraining equipment upon its own pilot. The positive applications of its skeletal anchoring and load-transfer principles to prosthetic rehabilitation are nonetheless equally present.\n\nApproved by ███████ and ███, the enclosed assault frame and its related technologies are designated class I sealed technology. Sale of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and its related technologies are to be progressively declassified once a colonial world&apos;s society attains class I standard. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file I: enclosed assault frame -->
  <DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology.\n\nThe heavy bionic suit can now be assembled at an artifuscle chamber. It lets its pilot carry and operate heavy weapons no ordinary soldier could handle.\n\nIt only works fully closed. Once a pilot is sealed in, it cannot be taken off by normal means and can only be stripped away destructively through surgery.\n\nThe fleets shelved this technology for a reason. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_BionicSuitHeavy.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: cluster command -->
  <DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.label>
  <!-- EN: A facility-scale computer assembled from arrays of microelectronic chips and the power system that drives them. Even a bare mainframe with no attached subsystems commands and coordinates mechs as capably as a human mechanitor. Technology of this kind was already in wide use in humanity&apos;s wars against itself long before it reached the stars, and after the expansion it was deployed in bulk on interstellar terraforming programs, bringing countless barren worlds to life.\n\nApproved by ████ and ██, cluster command and its related technologies are designated class I sealed technology. Provision of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and outside emergency war mobilization, standing ground-force deployments are to avoid employing it in any military operation. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file I: cluster command -->
  <DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: the technical architecture of a cluster command mainframe.\n\nThe central command core can now be built. A single mainframe commands automatroids without a mechanitor, supplying its own control bandwidth and command groups.\n\nBecause the convention caps the personnel that may be committed to a colonial program, the fleets keep this file sealed from standing armies and open it only for emergency mobilization. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_GestaltEngine.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: synthetic biology -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.label>
  <!-- EN: Cultured strains built from the ground up, engineered to reassemble simple nutrients and mineral feedstock into complex organic macromolecules. They synthesize neutroamine, edible artiprotein and comparable organic polymers at far higher efficiency than any conventional process, and require neither fields nor livestock to do it.\n\nApproved by █████ and ███, synthetic biology and its related technologies are designated class I sealed technology. Provision of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and derived biosynthesis lines are to be operated only within orbital installations and fleet supply nodes. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file I: synthetic biology -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology. It contains the gene maps and metabolic pathways of a set of engineered culture strains.\n\nArtiprotein can now be refined from crops in a reaction chamber, and neutroamine synthesized from meat and chemfuel. The artifuscle chamber can also grow artificial muscle from artiprotein and tungsteel, with no gold or neutroamine required.\n\nThe fleets did not seal this file over weapons. The large-scale spread of synthesis technology would very likely leave the industries it touches with severe structural unemployment for a long time to come. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Biosynthesis.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: infrasonics -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.label>
  <!-- EN: A tuned infrasound device is enough to inflict severe, irreversible damage on the sensory systems of the living things around it, along with pain intense enough to cause shock. The development of infrasonic weapons has therefore been prohibited under the laws of war. The positive applications of infrasonic technology to medicine and geological survey are nonetheless equally present.\n\nApproved by ████ and ██, infrasonics and its related technologies are designated class I sealed technology. Sale of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and its related technologies are to be progressively declassified once a colonial world&apos;s society attains class I standard. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file I: infrasonics -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: the design principles of tuned infrasound emitters and seismic survey charges.\n\nFour devices can now be produced: an infrasonic module that gives a mech an area panic ability, an infrasonic emitter tower that periodically drives off nearby enemies, infrasonic grenades that reach every living thing in their radius regardless of walls, and a blast scanner that maps deep ore with a mortar-driven shockwave.\n\nThe blast scanner&apos;s shockwave carries far into the ground. Whatever sleeps down there will hear it too.\n\nThe fleets sealed this file because of what these devices do to people. Fielding them openly will be noted. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Subsonic.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: garrison arsenal -->
  <DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.label>
  <!-- EN: A line of self-supervising sentry weapons built for long-term garrison duty: a quadruped garrison mech for installation security, a large drone platform that flies cover for unmanned mother-drones, and an automated nest that launches FPV suicide drones at intruders. All three were designed specifically for pioneer colonization operations, which needed defenses able to hold a world alone for decades before the fleet arrived, so all three carry fallback directives in their control cores that keep them executing their last standing order until the chassis fails.\nUnder the laws of war, weapons that outlast the conflict they were deployed for are classed alongside minefields. The remnants still guarding this world&apos;s beacons and installations are what these patterns become once their makers are gone.\n\nApproved by ████ and ███, the garrison arsenal and its related technologies are designated class I sealed technology. Sale of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and its related technologies are to be progressively declassified once a colonial world&apos;s society attains class I standard. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file I: garrison arsenal -->
  <DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: the production patterns of two remnant mechs and of the drone hive that garrisoned alongside them.\n\nThe bullhound, its flamer pattern the hellhound, and the Lanius can now be gestated at an automatroid constructor. Gestated units answer to their mechanitor like any other mech, with no limit on their operating range.\n\nThe FPV drone hive can now be built. Keep it loaded with steel and it will assemble and launch wildfowl suicide drones. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_RemnantPatterns.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: hydraulic fracturing -->
  <DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.label>
  <!-- EN: Ultra-high-pressure fluid tears the deep bedrock apart and frees the hydrocarbons and rare volatiles trapped in fissures in the crust. Even long after the surface deposits are exhausted, it keeps drawing chemfuel and minerals from underground. The mineral-laden slurry the process discharges, however, leaves severe heavy-metal pollution all around it.\nAs a means of resource extraction its industrial efficiency is extremely high, but spreading the technique across industrial worlds that lack environmental ethics can degrade a planet&apos;s living conditions rapidly, to the point that it is no longer habitable.\n\nApproved by ████ and ██, hydraulic fracturing extraction and its related technologies are designated class I sealed technology. Sale of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and its related technologies are to be progressively declassified once a colonial world&apos;s society attains class I standard. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file I: hydraulic fracturing -->
  <DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: an extraction method that splits deep bedrock open with ultra-high-pressure fluid.\n\nThe hydraulic fracturing rig can now be built. It mines the deep deposits around it automatically and, once they are exhausted, draws chemfuel and steel from the bedrock, at the cost of polluting the surrounding ground.\n\nThe fleets sealed this file so that the worlds it touches would still be fit to live on afterward. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_HydraulicFracturing.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: directed chassis gestation -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Frogman.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Frogman.label>
  <!-- EN: A sealed technique that cultivates artificial military organisms in place of printing mechs. A directed development sequence is written into an embryo, whose mesonuclear substrate then lays down synthetic-mechanical structure instead of biological tissue and matures on its own. The embryo is brought to term in a growth vat.\n\nFurther AMO development was stopped for good after a catastrophic incident in the Earth era. Self-developing military organisms do enormous harm to local society and productive capacity, and the technology has been proscribed ever since. The colonial fleets carry out the sanctions under this ban themselves, never through local authorities.\n\nUnlocks the XM132 Frogman and its development sequence. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Frogman.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Frogman.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file: directed chassis gestation -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Frogman.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Frogman.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: the XM132 Frogman, the earliest artificial military organism humanity is known to have put into development.\n\nThe Frogman&apos;s directed development sequence can now be produced. Culture an embryo at an artifuscle chamber, then bring it to term in a growth vat or a surrogate. The result is a biomatroid larva. Protect its gestation pod for five days and it will develop into a combat-ready Frogman.\n\nThe file carries a fleet prohibition notice. Producing AMOs is prohibited on any settled world, and the fleets enforce this ban in person. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_Frogman.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_Frogman.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: main battle specification -->
  <DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.label>
  <!-- EN: The design and production technology behind the total-war specification mechs and related equipment that the colonial fleets field against planet-scale hostile organizations and harmful entities. The manufacturing process of these mechs has been drastically simplified so that they serve better as high-performance weapons, produced and expended without pause over the course of a total war. Their performance, however, does not come from nowhere.\nAfter the main battle specification leak on colonial world ████, colonial fleets across sector ████ observed similar technology reaching interstellar pirates and spacefaring military regimes through arms dealers. The technology recovery programs each fleet carried out after the incident proved effective, and the main battle specification was sealed again after ████.\n\nTo prevent such an incident from happening again, however, approved by ████ and ██, the main battle specification and its related technologies are designated class II sealed technology. Provision of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and outside emergency war mobilization, standing ground-force deployments are to avoid employing it in any military operation. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file II: main battle specification -->
  <DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: the production patterns of the mechs the fleets build to be expended in total war.\n\nThe gravekeeper can now be gestated at a large automatroid constructor, either in its standard pattern or with a Stugna missile rack on its shoulder. Most of its parts are shared with the mobile dragoon.\n\nThe fleets sealed this file again after it leaked to pirates and military regimes, and they will move against anyone who holds it now. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_MainBattle.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: zero-point energy -->
  <DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.label>TODO</DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.label>
  <!-- EN: Draws energy from the quantum fluctuations of the vacuum itself. Once the principle is mastered, antiparticles can be consumed to produce solidified zero-point energy, which powers the most advanced machines and weapons. It is the threshold of transcendent technology. But the true cost of harnessing the void is something humanity has yet to fully understand.\n\nAfter the main battle ███ division that landed on planet ████ drove the transcendent machine ████ out of the planet&apos;s crust, where it had lain parasitic, in the year ████, colonial fleet ████ compiled a detailed account of how such transcendent beings are constituted and passed it by stele to the other colonial fleets operating in the Andromeda cluster. Because transcendent beings and their applications still contaminate the physical universe in ways that remain largely beyond control, disclosure of such technology to developing worlds is prohibited, and its related preventive technologies are to be declassified once a colonial world&apos;s society attains class II standard. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.description>TODO</DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.description>
  <!-- EN: Sealed file III: zero-point energy -->
  <DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.discoveredLetterTitle>TODO</DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Using the data they have gathered, researchers have finished decoding the sealed technology: the confinement principles behind solidified zero-point energy.\n\nThree devices can now be built. The zero-point generator core uses antigrain warheads as its catalyst and condenses solidified energy out of the vacuum, each warhead yielding 25 units over about a year. The zero-point reactor burns solidified energy for power, each unit supplying 6000 W for a full year. The reality anchor, built with solidified energy, stabilizes the space around it: nothing inside can exceed 120% of its natural limits, psycasts cannot be cast, and anomalous entities are suppressed.\n\nThis file is occulted. The fleets regard the knowledge itself as a contamination, and they will not forgive whoever holds it. -->
  <DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.discoveredLetterText>TODO</DMS_Occultech_ZeroPoint.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: Foundational drone tech -->
  <DMS_UAVBasis.label>drones basicos</DMS_UAVBasis.label>
  <!-- EN: Uses simple control logic and signal transceivers to unlock basic mechanical units. -->
  <DMS_UAVBasis.description>Uso de sensores y transceptores simples para lograr sistemas de drones simples pero prácticos.</DMS_UAVBasis.description>
  <!-- EN: Material Engineering -->
  <DMS_Material.label>ingeniería de materiales</DMS_Material.label>
  <!-- EN: &quot;A perfect material can be calculated through scientific method&quot; - one of the major breakthroughs mankind has ever achieved. -->
  <DMS_Material.description>Uso del poder del calor y la presión extremos para eliminar las impurezas del acero y la piedra para crear una aleación de tungstanio y una placa de cerámica de grado militar.</DMS_Material.description>
  <!-- EN: mass production -->
  <DMS_Autofacturer.label>producción en masa</DMS_Autofacturer.label>
  <!-- EN: Through improved production technology, the material processing and production process can be automated and scaled as much as possible. -->
  <DMS_Autofacturer.description>Mediante una tecnología de producción mejorada, el procesamiento de materiales y el proceso de producción pueden automatizarse y ampliarse tanto como sea posible.</DMS_Autofacturer.description>
  <!-- EN: Artificial Fiber -->
  <DMS_Plasfiber.label>fibra artificial</DMS_Plasfiber.label>
  <!-- EN: Unlocks the production of artificial fibers. Each of these man-made fabrics has its own advantages and drawbacks. -->
  <DMS_Plasfiber.description>Crea poliéster y plastifibra, telas artificiales sintetizadas por sus propiedades únicas en múltiples disciplinas.</DMS_Plasfiber.description>
  <!-- EN: Automatroid Basis -->
  <DMS_Automatroid.label>automatroides base</DMS_Automatroid.label>
  <!-- EN: These machines are called automatroids because they are not merely a weapon - they are an automatic weapon capable of judging and destroying a target on their own.\n\nA weapon this morally appalling should never have been accepted under normal circumstances, but it was used so widely by every power during the Third World War that it became an ordinary and unavoidable part of the battlefield long ago. -->
  <DMS_Automatroid.description>Los automatroides son armas autónomas capaces de ejecutar misiones tácticas sin intervalos de supervisión.\n\nEstas máquinas autónomas se convirtieron en un lugar común como reemplazo u oponentes de la infantería de primera línea porque el tratado de 2026 d.C. que se suponía que regularía su desarrollo fue rechazado por las principales potencias de la época.</DMS_Automatroid.description>
  <!-- EN: Mecha Gear -->
  <DMS_MechBasis.label>equipo mecha</DMS_MechBasis.label>
  <!-- EN: &quot;Mecha gear&quot; is a term covering the design patterns of modern mechanical engineering. It began as mockery of the exaggerated, unrealistic designs found in science fiction.\n\n After millennia of invention and refinement, however, advanced materials have become the foundation that puts those designs into practice. -->
  <DMS_MechBasis.description>"Equipo mecha" se originó como un término para diseños de maquinaria futuros que no se podían obtener con la tecnología antigua.\n\nSin embargo, un milenio de avances en la construcción de materiales ha hecho que estos diseños previamente poco realistas se vuelvan factibles.</DMS_MechBasis.description>
  <!-- EN: Legion -->
  <DMS_Legion.label>legión</DMS_Legion.label>
  <!-- EN: A series of automatroids designed for large-scale warfare. Most of them carry only a simple weapon control system, but their clear division of labor and low production cost make them the most impressive combat weapon ever fielded in terms of sheer scale of service. -->
  <DMS_Legion.description>Esta serie de automatroides está diseñada para la guerra a gran escala. Tienen sistemas de control de armas simples y no pueden empuñar armas pesadas, pero la facilidad de producción y los bajos costos hacen que estas unidades sean la columna vertebral de muchas líneas de artillería de automatroides.</DMS_Legion.description>
  <!-- EN: Neural Prosthesis -->
  <DMS_Prosthetic.label>prótesis neural</DMS_Prosthetic.label>
  <!-- EN: Neural prosthetics are semi-organic bionic limbs designed specifically for wounded and disabled soldiers. The adaptation training they demand is all but negligible. Out of concern for durability and mass production, however, they do not work as efficiently as the original limb. -->
  <DMS_Prosthetic.description>Prótesis neurales diseñadas para soldados discapacitados. Son duraderas y se adaptan fácilmente, y requieren una formación mínima para que el paciente se sienta cómodo. Sin embargo, debido al desgaste natural de sus componentes mecánicos, estos reemplazos protésicos no son tan eficientes como sus contrapartes de carne originales.</DMS_Prosthetic.description>
  <!-- EN: Dead Man&apos;s Switch -->
  <DMS_DeadMansSwitch.label>Dead Man's Switch</DMS_DeadMansSwitch.label>
  <!-- EN: The dead man&apos;s switch is a mechanical safety mechanism intended to automatically terminate active equipment the moment its operator is incapacitated.\n\nBefore mankind explored space, they found that this mechanism would eventually let an artificial intelligence understand, to some degree... the meaning of death.\n That discovery carried mankind into a new era of history...\n\n the era of the fifth-level artificial intelligence. -->
  <DMS_DeadMansSwitch.description>El Dead Man's Switch es un mecanismo a prueba de fallos destinado a inducir la secuencia de autodestrucción cuando el supervisor está incapacitado.\n\nLos investigadores se dieron cuenta de que este mecanismo a prueba de fallos no solo resolvía el problema de la detención, sino que también hacía que la inteligencia artificial comprendiera el significado de la muerte y la autoconservación, lo que tuvo importantes ramificaciones para la humanidad.\n\nDesbloquea la construcción de antenas señuelo que atraerán a un grupo de automatroides rebeldes al transpondedor.</DMS_DeadMansSwitch.description>
  <!-- EN: About: Special Components -->
  <DMS_DeadMansSwitch.discoveredLetterTitle>Acerca de: Piezas Avanzadas</DMS_DeadMansSwitch.discoveredLetterTitle>
  <!-- EN: Some automatroids require specific critical components, and those components cannot be manufactured inside a gravity well.\n\n The colonial fleet has told us we are free to lure in and destroy any automatroid that has left the chain of command in order to obtain them. -->
  <DMS_DeadMansSwitch.discoveredLetterText>Algunos automatroides avanzados requieren piezas específicas que solo se fabrican en entornos de baja gravedad.\n\nEl Alto Mando Colonial hace la vista gorda a la atracción y destrucción de sus automatroides rebeldes que contendrán los componentes necesarios para un mayor progreso.</DMS_DeadMansSwitch.discoveredLetterText>
  <!-- EN: Artificial Muscle -->
  <DMS_Artifuscle.label>músculo artificial</DMS_Artifuscle.label>
  <!-- EN: Artifuscle is a prosthetic material grown from genetically engineered stock: bundles of sauropsid muscle fiber sheathed in artificial biological fiber, which gives it a very high compatibility with living tissue. It did not take long for the arms manufacturers to realize what biological-mechanical hybrid technology meant for the future. -->
  <DMS_Artifuscle.description>El artimúsculo es un tipo de material protésico hecho de haces de fibras musculares cultivadas en laboratorio y mejoradas genéticamente. El artimúsculo se abrió paso en los mercados militares y civiles, y no pasó mucho tiempo para que los desarrolladores militares se dieran cuenta del futuro de las armas híbridas mecánico-biológicas.</DMS_Artifuscle.description>
  <!-- EN: Pioneer Equipment -->
  <DMS_EquipmentBasis.label>equipo de pionero</DMS_EquipmentBasis.label>
  <!-- EN: Uniforms and equipment designed mainly for colonial use, including sealed suits for surviving hostile environments. -->
  <DMS_EquipmentBasis.description>Uniformes y equipo diseñados para humanos, principalmente para uso civil y situaciones de supervivencia de emergencia. Incluye uniformes básicos y armas de fuego que suelen manejar tanto los milicianos como los colonos.</DMS_EquipmentBasis.description>
  <!-- EN: Cluster Transceiver -->
  <DMS_Mechlink.label>mecatransceptor</DMS_Mechlink.label>
  <!-- EN: The cluster transceiver is a method humans developed for controlling automatroids in war. For those automatroids that have developed self-awareness, of course, the method is not a comfortable one. -->
  <DMS_Mechlink.description>El mecatransceptor es una forma de controlar robots en un espacio de batalla. Se ha observado que las unidades mecánicas que han obtenido autoconciencia como resultado del Dead Man Switch se resisten a las directivas proporcionadas por estos transceptores.</DMS_Mechlink.description>
  <!-- EN: Defense Equipment -->
  <DMS_EquipmentAdvanced.label>equipo de defensa</DMS_EquipmentAdvanced.label>
  <!-- EN: Equipment for colony defense and riot control. -->
  <DMS_EquipmentAdvanced.description>Equipo diseñado para humanos y automatroides. Es un paso por encima del equipo de supervivencia que se entrega a los pioneros, con mejores tolerancias y calidad en sus diseños. Este equipo es más adecuado para operaciones defensivas debido a su alcance limitado.</DMS_EquipmentAdvanced.description>
  <!-- EN: Military Equipment -->
  <DMS_EquipmentElite.label>equipo militar</DMS_EquipmentElite.label>
  <!-- EN: Equipment designed primarily for automatroid use. Most of it is heavy enough that it is unsuitable for a human to handle. -->
  <DMS_EquipmentElite.description>Este equipo está diseñado principalmente para uso de automatroides, ya que es demasiado pesado para que lo opere un humano no aumentado. Consiste en armas pesadas y herramientas de apertura, así como plataformas de defensa de alto calibre.</DMS_EquipmentElite.description>
  <!-- EN: Heavy Weaponry -->
  <DMS_EquipmentHeavy.label>armamento pesado</DMS_EquipmentHeavy.label>
  <!-- EN: Special equipment built around heavy automatroids and specialized models. No matter how strong a human is, they simply cannot lift it, so it is unsuitable for human use. -->
  <DMS_EquipmentHeavy.description>Potencia de fuego de servicio pesado diseñada para los automatroides más grandes. Este equipo es demasiado pesado para ser operado por unidades de automatroides más pequeñas y consiste en soluciones de supremacía de fuego seguras para cambiar el rumbo de cualquier guerra en la que se introduzcan. Incluye cañones automáticos de alto calibre, cañones antitanque y plataformas de defensa.</DMS_EquipmentHeavy.description>
  <!-- EN: Battle Friends -->
  <DMS_BattleFrame.label>amigo de batalla</DMS_BattleFrame.label>
  <!-- EN: The records are old enough that we have never established whether their proper designation was &quot;battle frames&quot; or &quot;battle friends&quot;. Either way they are automatroids, serving as a frame for operating equipment or as a companion in a fight. -->
  <DMS_BattleFrame.description>Debido a un error administrativo, no se ha determinado si el término correcto para estas máquinas es "battle frames" o "battle friends".\n\nSon automatroides equipados con marcos de exoesqueleto que se pueden personalizar para adaptarse a las necesidades del operador. Son útiles en combate y en las operaciones mundanas de la vida diaria de la colonia.</DMS_BattleFrame.description>
  <!-- EN: Hybrid Engineering -->
  <DMS_Hybrid.label>ingeniería híbrida</DMS_Hybrid.label>
  <!-- EN: Biological-mechanical hybrid technology was established during the Third World War. Mercenaries from some of the belligerent nations founded an armed state made up of military personnel, meant to secure rights for mercenaries whom the humanitarian conventions had never protected, and used drones and synthetic prosthetics to return discharged wounded veterans to the battlefield.\n\nThe world&apos;s militaries soon recognized what biomechanical hybrids meant for modern warfare, and armed their own forces with them. -->
  <DMS_Hybrid.description>El establecimiento de la tecnología híbrida biológico-mecánica durante la tercera guerra mundial vio a mercenarios independientes establecer un estado soberano con personal que usaba drones y prótesis híbridas. Sus fuerzas consistían en veteranos heridos descartados que regresaron a luchar por su causa debido a los avances en la ingeniería biomecánica y las prótesis. También desarrollaron una munición que inutilizaba la munición de carga avanzada de los ejércitos del mundo.\n\nDespués de su eventual masacre, su creación del obús cortacargas permaneció como su único legado.</DMS_Hybrid.description>
  <!-- EN: Biosynthetic Prosthetics -->
  <DMS_Bionics.label>prótesis biosintéticas</DMS_Bionics.label>
  <!-- EN: As automatroid and bionic engineering advanced, manufacturing bionic automatroids with biological-mechanical hybrid technology became possible. -->
  <DMS_Bionics.description>Con los avances en la ingeniería robótica y biónica, la tecnología híbrida biológico-mecánica se ha vuelto factible.\n\nDesbloquea brazos y piernas biosintéticos, así como el suero necesario para ayudar al cuerpo a aceptar dicho reemplazo.</DMS_Bionics.description>
  <!-- EN: Organ Replacement -->
  <DMS_OrganSurgery.label>reemplazo de órganos</DMS_OrganSurgery.label>
  <!-- EN: Mankind gave up a great deal in that long war... and even where the loss could later be made good, some things were gone forever. -->
  <DMS_OrganSurgery.description>Desbloquea la creación de puertos de nutrición y filtros sensoriales que permiten atenuar los sentimientos emocionales y agilizar el proceso de ingesta nutricional. Si bien estos son ciertamente más eficientes que su contraparte orgánica, ¿qué se pierde para siempre en la búsqueda de la máxima eficiencia?</DMS_OrganSurgery.description>
  <!-- EN: Wetware Hypothesis -->
  <DMS_Hypothesis.label>hipótesis de biocomputadora</DMS_Hypothesis.label>
  <!-- EN: After the discovery of the dead man&apos;s switch, AI algorithm engineer Yanzhi Jiang proposed a hypothetical solution to the halting problem...\n\nAnd working around that conjecture, we seem to be drawing closer and closer to the so-called universal machine. -->
  <DMS_Hypothesis.description>Después del descubrimiento del Dead Man's Switch, un ingeniero de algoritmos de IA, Yánzhi Jiang, propuso una solución hipotética al problema de la detención.\n\nLa biocomputadora fue creado como una prueba de concepto, sirviendo como un cerebro orgánico activado en serie con Dead Man's Switch que permite a los automatroides despertar y continuar luchando después de que su operador se haya desactivado. Las pruebas preliminares indicaron que una parte de la personalidad del operador se transpuso al automatroide, pero dichos informes desaparecieron tan rápido como se hicieron.\n\nPermite la construcción de radares señuelo y automatroides más pesados, así como la síntesis de biocomputadoras.</DMS_Hypothesis.description>
  <!-- EN: Heavy Automatroid -->
  <DMS_HeavyAutomatroid.label>automatroide pesado</DMS_HeavyAutomatroid.label>
  <!-- EN: These heavy machines once stood ready for total war between nations. Fortunately, war on that scale does not happen often. -->
  <DMS_HeavyAutomatroid.description>Estas máquinas masivas fueron construidas a propósito para la guerra a gran escala entre naciones.\n\nDesbloquea varios automatroides de asalto que se inspiraron en vehículos y tecnología de la vieja guerra, pero con un toque modernizado.</DMS_HeavyAutomatroid.description>
  <!-- EN: Ergonomics -->
  <DMS_HumanoidEngineering.label>ingeniería humana</DMS_HumanoidEngineering.label>
  <!-- EN: Humanoid automatroids are humanoid because, compared to other animals, a human is an exceptionally cooperative test subject for training a neural network in a wide range of tactical movements. Humanoid automatroids trained and produced this way also inherit compatibility with human environments and human tools. -->
  <DMS_HumanoidEngineering.description>Durante las primeras guerras, se demostró que los automatroides con formas humanas eran eficaces para desmoralizar a los combatientes humanos e infligir traumas psicológicos en las líneas enemigas. Esto condujo al desarrollo de una serie de automatroides considerados los modelos arcabusero.</DMS_HumanoidEngineering.description>
  <!-- EN: Specialized design -->
  <DMS_Ronin.label>pacificadores</DMS_Ronin.label>
  <!-- EN: Following the end of the Cold War, rapid breakthroughs in microelectronics freed automatroid configuration and systems integration from the constraints of amorphous neural circuitry. From then on automatroid designs could branch into specialized models at a lower development cost, meeting the low-intensity but complicated demands of the new era of warfare - counter-terrorism, policing actions and the like. -->
  <DMS_Ronin.description>Una serie de modelos de automatroides, variantes del arcabusero diseñados para la guerra urbana, estos modelos cuentan con una armadura pesada, una movilidad ultrarrápida y una variedad de armamento compatible. Esta línea de automatroides sobresale en entornos urbanos y combate a corta distancia, pero también puede funcionar como pacificadores menos letales y unidades de control de disturbios.</DMS_Ronin.description>
  <!-- EN: Next-Gen Weaponry -->
  <DMS_Synthroid.label>nueva generación</DMS_Synthroid.label>
  <!-- EN: The arms race centered on biological-mechanical hybrids continued all the way to the Fourth World War, and had reached unimaginable heights long before anyone recognized the problem.\n\nWhat followed were the so-called next-generation weapons and the next-generation war they brought with them - a war that very nearly ended Earth. -->
  <DMS_Synthroid.description>El desarrollo de armas centrado en híbridos biomecánicos continuó hasta la cuarta guerra mundial, donde alcanzó alturas incomprensibles.\n\nEste fue el comienzo de las armas de nueva generación que finalmente conducirían a la destrucción del planeta.\n\nDesbloquea el tarbosaurio, un temible automatroide depredador con la forma del poderoso carnotaurus sastrei capaz de albergar suficiente potencia de fuego para destruir ciudades enteras si no se controla.</DMS_Synthroid.description>
